      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Gabriel / Freddy.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 1 as a spirit. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Frontman of the Original Five</strong> — The original five animatronics of the Hurricane Freddy Fazbear's Pizza (involuntarily) / Fazbear franchise</p><p>Status: Released — set free on Night Seven at 1:47 AM on the 21st of Autumn's End, 1038 BF, in the dissipation event the Mages' Guild filed as 'an unexplained but benign release of bound spiritual energy, origin unknown'</p><p>Gabriel is the child whose spirit was bound to Freddy Fazbear, the lead performer of the original five animatronics at the Hurricane Freddy Fazbear's Pizza — the franchise's crown jewel, and the place where the original five children were murdered. He spent decades on that main stage haunting the night security staff, outlasting the animatronics themselves, until Wario's seven-night tenure ended in the Secret Bunker and thirty years of sustained grief released its hold. The record lists him with two words and no complaints: Released Night Seven.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Withering Touch</strong> — “The Frontman of the Original Five”</li><li><strong>Incorporeal Movement</strong> — “He spent decades on that main stage haunting the night security staff, outlasting the animatronics themselves, until Wario's seven-night tenure ended in the Secret Bunker and thirty years of sustained grief released its”</li><li><strong>Studio Trained</strong> — “Gabriel is the child whose spirit was bound to Freddy Fazbear, the lead performer of the original five animatronics at the Hurricane Freddy Fazbear's Pizza — the franchise's crown jewel, and the place where the original”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/gabriel_freddy</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/gabriel_freddy</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
